info.description:
DR Non PCI - create port groups with source names and VLAN IDs.

Source 'VMware HCIA Distributed Switch' (76 PGs) -> VDS 1 = {{vds1_name}}
Source 'DMZ-Networks-DRC' (3 PGs) -> VDS 2 = {{vds2_name}}

No scripts. Copy IDs from responses into environment variables between steps. Disable SSL verification in Postman if vCenter is self-signed.

